          "response_text": "Six additions, no restructuring: (1) §9's v1 proposal-mode enforcement is unplaced — add to P6 the retro 'shrink the panel' proposal (ensemble yield <25% for two runs) and the 'revert verifier to opt-in' proposal (behavioral-signal miss), add metrics.verifier.legit_findings emission to P5, and rename P6's metric to §9's metrics.registry.rematched. (2) P2's acceptance_gate runs pytest --collect-only, which imports conftest/test modules — engine-executed branch code outside judge hooks and before P5's sandbox exists; make an explicit decision (run enumeration under the P5 backend once it lands; document or mitigate the P2-P4 interim exposure). (3) Define panel-member failure semantics in P1: a member error/usage-limit parks the cycle fail-closed, completed members' findings persist for resume, and window admission scales its estimate by panel size. (4) Pin P6 version provenance: prompt/lens/schema version = content hash (PRD example triage@4d3722e), 'in force' = matches the file in the current tree; name where the ratified version registry lives. (5) Add the Q2-mandated gauntlet doctor probe of the Gemini model id to P1 with a test. (6) Add a P9 fixture asserting the PRD §8 FR-6/FR-4 interaction: a final round holding a carried remainder fails the clean predicate and auto_when_clean parks.",
